OL,3,GNEWSAGreengrocer sent good wishes ahead
OL,4,Aof retirement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Gloucestershire town is getting ready
OL,7,Fto wish a happy retirement to a
OL,8,Fgreengrocer who is shutting shop.
OL,10,FThe Choice is Yours in Market Place,
OL,11,FColeford, Forest of Dean, is set to
OL,12,Fclose later on Saturday, after 26
OL,13,Fyears.
OL,15,FPat Scott continued running the
OL,16,Fbusiness after the death of her husband
OL,17,FAdam 14 years ago and their independent
OL,18,Fcompany has been trading for more than
OL,19,F50 years.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
